<article class="item" id="Log">
<div class="item-head"><h3><a href="#Log">Log</a></h3><span class="kind">effect</span></div>
<pre class="signature"><code><span class="kw">effect</span> <a class="ty" href="#Log">Log</a></code></pre>
<div class="doc">
<p>Writes log lines.</p>
</div>
<ul class="children">
<li id="Log.info"><pre class="signature"><code><span class="kw">fn</span> info(msg: <span class="ty">String</span>) -&gt; ()</code></pre>
<div class="doc">
<p>One line at the info level.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
</article>
<article class="item" id="Prefixed">
<div class="item-head"><h3><a href="#Prefixed">Prefixed</a></h3><span class="kind">handler</span></div>
<pre class="signature"><code><span class="kw">handler</span> <a class="ty" href="#Prefixed">Prefixed</a>(prefix: <span class="ty">String</span>): <a class="ty" href="#Log">Log</a></code></pre>
<div class="doc">
<p>Prefixes each line.</p>
</div>
<ul class="children">
<li id="Prefixed.prefix"><pre class="signature"><code>prefix: <span class="ty">String</span></code></pre>
</li>
</ul>
</article>
