</article>
<article class="item" id="find">
<div class="item-head"><h3><a href="#find">find</a></h3><span class="kind">fn</span></div>
<pre class="signature"><code><span class="kw">fn</span> find(id: <span class="ty">Int</span>) -&gt; <a class="ty" href="#Point">Point</a> <span class="kw">fails</span> <a class="ty" href="#NotFound">NotFound</a> | <a class="ty" href="#Timeout">Timeout</a> <span class="kw">use</span> <a class="ty" href="#Log">Log</a></code></pre>
<div class="doc">
<p>Finds a point, or fails.</p>
<p>Indented lines stay indented:</p>
<pre><code>find(<span class="num">1</span>)</code></pre>
</div>
</article>
<article class="item" id="apply">
<div class="item-head"><h3><a href="#apply">apply</a></h3><span class="kind">fn</span></div>
